#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable All Thresholds"
msgstr "Kashe Duk Iyakoki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Alerting on all Thresholds.  This can be used when it is necessary to perform maintenance on your network."
msgstr "Yin alama a wannan akwatin zai kashe Faɗakarwa a kan dukkan Iyakoki. Ana iya amfani da wannan lokacin da ya zama dole a yi gyara a kan hanyar sadarwarka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Auto Create Thresholds"
msgstr "Ƙirƙiri Iyakoki da Kansa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If selected, when running either automation, or when creating/saving a Device, all Thresholds associated with the Device Template will be created."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, yayin gudanar da sarrafa kai tsaye, ko yayin ƙirƙira/ajiye Na'ura, za a ƙirƙiri dukkan Iyakoki da ke da alaƙa da Samfurin Na'ura."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Ɗauki Bayanan da Ba a Sani Ba a Matsayin Sifili"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When checking Thresholds, if a Data Source returns Unknown Data ('U'), consider the value as zero for the Threshold check. You can also enable log this issue."
msgstr "Lokacin duba Iyakoki, idan Tushen Bayanai ya dawo da Bayanan da ba a sani ba ('U'), ɗauki ƙimar a matsayin sifili don duba Iyaka. Haka kuma za ka iya kunna rubuta wannan matsalar a rajista."

