#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "Tsohuwar Ƙimar ifHighSpeed idan Babu Komai"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Lokacin da ake lissafin Iyakokin Furci, idan ifHighSpeed da ifSpeed suka dawo a matsayin sifili, yi amfani da wannan saitin ifHighSpeed a madadinsa. Tsohon ifHighSpeed zai zama 10000 don musayar 10GE."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Sanarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Kashe Tsofaffin Sanarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Yin alama a wannan akwatin zai kashe Tsohuwar Faɗakarwa a kan dukkan Iyakoki. Ana bayyana Tsohuwar Faɗakarwa a matsayin duk wata Keɓantacciyar Faɗakarwar Imel da ba ta da alaƙa da Jerin Sanarwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Sanarwar Iyaka Mai Samfuri"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, yayin ƙirƙirar Samfurin Iyaka, Samfurin Iyaka ne zai mallaki Saitunan Sanarwa nasa ta tsoho."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Kunna Aiwatar da Umarni"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Yin alama a wannan akwatin zai kunna ikon gudanar da umarnai lokacin ketare Iyaka da lokutan dawowa daidai."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Kunna Sanarwa ga Kowane Thold"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Yin alama a wannan akwatin zai kunna ikon kiyaye rubutun Imel na musamman don Iyakoki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Kunna Layin Jiran Sanarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Yin alama a wannan akwatin zai mayar da Thold daga yin Sanarwa kai tsaye zuwa amfani da ko dai Notification Daemon, ko sanarwoyin da Mai Tattara Bayanai na Sanarwa ke yi a waje."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Kunna Aika Imel ɗin Faɗakarwa zuwa Jerin Sanarwoyin Gargaɗi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Yi alama a wannan akwatin idan kana son masu karɓa a Jerin Sanarwar Gargaɗi su karɓi Imel na Faɗakarwa ƙari ga masu karɓa a jerin Sanarwar Faɗakarwa. Wannan ya shafi lokacin da Sanarwar Gargaɗi ke zuwa ga Masu Gudanarwa kuma Sanarwar Faɗakarwa ke zuwa ga Hukumar Gudanarwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon na Iyaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Kunna Daemon na Iyaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Yin alama a wannan akwatin zai kunna amfani da keɓantaccen Threshold daemon. Ana iya amfani da wannan don ƙara ƙarfin aikin tsarin da/ko raba kulawar Iyaka zuwa wata sabar daban."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Tilasta Binciken Kuskure na Daemon ɗin Iyaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Yin alama a wannan akwatin zai kunna binciken kuskure na Threshold Daemon lokacin da yake aiki daga SystemD ko ta layin umarni. Wannan sauyi yana aiki nan take kuma zai fara aiki da zarar zagayen Iyaka na gaba ya fara."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Yawan Sanarwar Faɗuwar Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Idan an gano Thold Daemon ya daina aiki, a aika sanarwar Imel a wannan mitar lokaci."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Kowace Sa'a %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Zaruruwan Daemon"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Adadin zaren aikin daemon da Threshold Daemon zai sarrafa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "Aiki 1"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "Ayyuka %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Rajista"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Yi Rajistar Ketare Iyaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Kunna adana rajistar duk gazawar Iyaka zuwa Rajistar Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Nuna Tushen Bayanai a cikin Rajista"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Nuna sunan Tushen Bayanai a cikin Rajista idan ba ya nan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Yi Rajistar Sauye-sauyen Iyaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Kunna adana rajistar duk sauye-sauyen Iyaka zuwa Rajistar Cacti."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Rajistar Gano Kuskure"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Kunna adana rajistar saƙonnin gyaran kuskure tare da Iyaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Adana Rajistar Faɗakarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Ajiye Rajistan Iyaka na wannan adadin kwanaki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Yi rajistar matakin ɗaukar bayanan da ba a sani ba a matsayin sifili"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Lokacin da aka kunna 'Ɗauki Bayanan da Ba a Sani Ba a Matsayin Sifili', a rubuta lokacin da hakan ya faru"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "An kunna Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, yayin ƙirƙirar sabuwar Iyaka, ta tsoho za a aika sabbin abubuwan da suka faru na Iyaka zuwa syslog na gida. Wannan saitin saiti ne na farko. Saitunan Iyaka ne ke ƙayyade ainihin sarrafa syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Fifiko/Mataki na Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Wannan shine Fifiko/Mataki na asali da Thold zai yi amfani da shi don aika saƙonnin syslog. Wannan saitin tsohon saiti ne. Saitunan Iyaka su ne ke ƙayyade ainihin sarrafa syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Sashe na Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Wannan shine Rukunin (Facility) na asali da Thold zai yi amfani da shi don aika saƙonnin syslog. Wannan saitin tsohon saiti ne. Saitunan Iyaka su ne ke ƙayyade ainihin sarrafa syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Saitunan Farko na Faɗakarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Keɓancewar ƙarshen mako"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan, Thold ba zai yi aiki a ƙarshen mako ba."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Adadin Tada Faɗakarwa na Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Adadin lokuta a jere na asali da Tushen Bayanai dole ya karya Iyaka kafin a tada Faɗakarwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Sake faɗakarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Maimaita Faɗakarwa bayan ƙayyadadden adadin zagayen mai tattara bayanai."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Ma'aunin Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Tsohon Tsawon Lokacin Ma'aunin Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Wannan shine tsohuwar ƙimar da ake amfani da ita wajen ƙirƙirar Iyakoki ko samfura."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Adadin Kunna Ma'aunin Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Adadin lokuta a jere na asali da Tushen Bayanai dole ya karya Iyakar Tushe da aka lissafa kafin a tada Faɗakarwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Kashi na Karkatar Ma'aunin Asali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Sanarwar SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "Sanarwoyin SNMP"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Za a aika saƙonnin matsayin iyaka (informs/traps) zuwa ga masu karɓar sanarwar SNMP. Wannan ya haɗa da Faɗakarwa, Gargaɗi da tarkon Maido da Matsayi ta tsohuwa. Lura: Wannan fasalin yana buƙatar ƙarin manhajar Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Kashe Sanarwar Gargaɗi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan, Iyaka ba za ta aika sanarwa ba lokacin da aka keta Iyakar gargaɗi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Kashe Sanarwar Dawo da Aiki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Idan an zaɓi wannan, Iyaka ba za ta aika sanarwa ba lokacin da Iyaka ta koma matsayi na al'ada."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Aika Imel"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Aika Imel da Fifiko na Gaggawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Yana ba ka damar saita Imel da fifikon gaggawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Aika Faɗakarwa a Matsayin Rubutu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, wannan zai sa a aika dukkan Faɗakarwa a matsayin Imel na rubutu tsantsa ba tare da jadawali ba. Tsoffin saituna sune Imel na HTML tare da jadawali a ciki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Aika Imel daban-daban ga kowane adireshi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, wannan zai sa a aika dukkan Imel daban-daban ga kowane adireshi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Adireshin Imel na Mai Aikawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Wannan shine adireshin Imel da Iyaka za ta bayyana kamar daga gare shi ne."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Sunan Mai Aikawa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Wannan shine ainihin sunan da Iyaka za ta bayyana kamar daga gare shi ne."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Sanarwar Na'ura"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Kunna Sanarwoyi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Kunna sanarwar mai masauki da ya mutu/ke farfaɗowa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Sanarwar Imel Ɗaya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Supported for Notification Lists and the Notification Queue only.  If there are Down Device Notifications in a single processing cycle.  Send only one Email to Notification List repipients for all Devices."
msgstr "Ana goyon baya don Jerin Sanarwa da Layin Sanarwa kaɗai.  Idan akwai Sanarwar Na'ura da Ta Tsaya a cikin zagaye guda na sarrafawa.  Aika Imel guda ɗaya kawai ga masu karɓar Jerin Sanarwa don dukkan Na'urori."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification Subject"
msgstr "Taken Sanarwar Imel Ɗaya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Subject to be used for all Single Email Notification Emails for both Up and Down Devices."
msgstr "Wannan shine Batun Imel da za a yi amfani da shi don dukkan Imel na Sanarwar Imel Guda Ɗaya don duka Na'urori masu Aiki da Waɗanda Ba Su Aiki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Delay Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Jinkirin Sanarwar Na'ura"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Delay"
msgstr "Jinkirin Sanarwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If a large influx of Down Device Notifications come in, Cacti can pause sending out those Notifications for a certain period of time to see if the issue is transient before sending them out.  Select the threshold Down Device Notifications before the Pause is Triggered."
