#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "High Trigger Command"
msgstr "Umarnin Tada Iyaka ta Sama"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a High Threshold is breached, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data Input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Idan an saita, kuma idan aka keta Babbar Iyaka, za a gudanar da wannan umarnin. Da fatan za a shigar da ingantaccen umarni. Bugu da ƙari, akwai alamomin maye gurbi da dama da za a iya amfani da su don tura bayanai daga Iyaka zuwa rubutun shirin (script). Za ka iya yin hakan a matsayin hujjoji a kan layin umarni, ko kuma abin da ya fi dacewa, a cikin yanayin rubutun shirin. Dukkan ƙimomin maye gurbi za su bayyana a cikin yanayin rubutun shirin tare da prefix na THOLD_. Don haka, misali CURRENTVALUE zai zama THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, da sauransu. Masu canjin sun haɗa da: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. A ƙarshe, ana iya yin maye gurbin Mai Masauki, Tambayar Bayanai da Shigarwar Bayanai. Misali, idan kana da bayanan shigarwa na musamman mai suna pending, don yin maye gurbin yi amfani da |pending|. Don maye gurbin Tambayar Bayanai da Mai Masauki, yi amfani da ƙa'idodin Cacti |query_xxxx|, da |host_xxxx| bi da bi."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Low Trigger Command"
msgstr "Umarnin Tada Na Ƙasa"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a Low Threshold is breached, this command will be run. Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Idan an saita, kuma idan aka keta Ƙaramar Iyaka, za a gudanar da wannan umarnin. Da fatan za a shigar da ingantaccen umarni. Bugu da ƙari, akwai alamomin maye gurbi da dama da za a iya amfani da su don tura bayanai daga Iyaka zuwa rubutun shirin (script). Za ka iya yin hakan a matsayin hujjoji a kan layin umarni, ko kuma abin da ya fi dacewa, a cikin yanayin rubutun shirin. Dukkan ƙimomin maye gurbi za su bayyana a cikin yanayin rubutun shirin tare da prefix na THOLD_. Don haka, misali CURRENTVALUE zai zama THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, da sauransu. Masu canjin sun haɗa da: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. A ƙarshe, ana iya yin maye gurbin Mai Masauki, Tambayar Bayanai da Shigarwar Bayanai. Misali, idan kana da bayanan shigarwa na musamman mai suna pending, don yin maye gurbin yi amfani da |pending|. Don maye gurbin Tambayar Bayanai da Mai Masauki, yi amfani da ƙa'idodin Cacti |query_xxxx|, da |host_xxxx| bi da bi."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Norm Trigger Command"
msgstr "Umarnin Tada Yanayin Al'ada"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, when a thold falls back to a normal value, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Idan an saita, lokacin da iyaka (thold) ta koma ƙima ta al'ada, za a gudanar da wannan umarnin. Da fatan za a shigar da ingantaccen umarni. Bugu da ƙari, akwai alamomin maye gurbi da dama da za a iya amfani da su don tura bayanai daga Iyaka zuwa rubutun shirin (script). Za ka iya yin hakan a matsayin hujjoji a kan layin umarni, ko kuma abin da ya fi dacewa, a cikin yanayin rubutun shirin. Dukkan ƙimomin maye gurbi za su bayyana a cikin yanayin rubutun shirin tare da prefix na THOLD_. Don haka, misali CURRENTVALUE zai zama THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, da sauransu. Masu canjin sun haɗa da: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. A ƙarshe, ana iya yin maye gurbin Mai Masauki, Tambayar Bayanai da Shigarwar Bayanai. Misali, idan kana da bayanan shigarwa na musamman mai suna pending, don yin maye gurbin yi amfani da |pending|. Don maye gurbin Tambayar Bayanai da Mai Masauki, yi amfani da ƙa'idodin Cacti |query_xxxx|, da |host_xxxx| bi da bi."

