#: thold_templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "An RPN Expression is an RRDtool Compatible RPN Expression.  Syntax includes all functions below in addition to both Device and Data Query replacement expressions such as <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  To use a Data Source in the RPN Expression, you must use the syntax: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  For example, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> will get the current value of the traffic_in Data Source for the RRDfile(s) associated with the Graph. Any Data Source for a Graph can be included.<br>Math Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Flow Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Comparison Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"
msgstr "Kalaman RPN kalmomi ne na RPN waɗanda suka dace da RRDtool. Tsarin rubutu ya haɗa da duk ayyukan da ke ƙasa tare da kalaman maye na Na'ura da Tambayar Bayanai kamar <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>. Domin amfani da Tushen Bayanai a cikin Kalaman RPN, dole ne ka yi amfani da tsarin rubutu: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>. Misali, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> zai samo ƙimar yanzu ta Tushen Bayanai na traffic_in don fayil(fayilolin) RRD masu alaƙa da Jadawali. Za a iya haɗa kowane Tushen Bayanai na Jadawali.<br>Masu Aiki na Lissafi: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Ayyuka: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Masu Aiki na Gudana: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Ayyukan Kwatanta: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"

